{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0173W5416yb8bMP2kS6Run22","type":"tool_result","content":"# 한빛페이 해외카드 파트너 정산 (overseas-card-settlement)\n\n해외 가맹 파트너의 카드 승인 건을 원화로 환산해 일자·파트너별로 정산하고,\n파트너가 보내 주는 명세와 대사(reconcile)하는 배치/운영 콘솔이다.\n\n## 구성\n```\nsrc/api       SettlementApi(퍼사드), ReportFormatter, Main(운영 CLI)\nsrc/service   SettlementService, ReconcileService, RateService, RateBoardService, ...\nsrc/infra     FxqClient(환율 벤더 CLI 호출), DataFiles(CSV)\nsrc/domain    레코드 타입\nsrc/util      Money, Csv\nconf/         app.properties (SETTLE_* 환경변수 / -Dsettle.* 로 덮어쓰기)\nfixtures/     샘플 데이터 (2026-10-01 ~ 10-05)\nvendor/bin/   환율 벤더 제공 CLI `fxq` (벤더 배포본 — 저장소에서 수정하지 않는다)\n```\n\n## 실행\n```\nJDK=$HOME/.sdkman/candidates/java/21.0.5-tem/bin\n$JDK/javac -encoding UTF-8 -d out $(find src -name '*.java')\n$JDK/java -cp out api.Main report    2026-10-01 2026-10-05\n$JDK/java -cp out api.Main reconcile 2026-10-01 2026-10-05\n$JDK/java -cp out api.Main export    2026-10-01 2026-10-05\n$JDK/java -cp out api.Main board     2026-10-03\n```\n\n## 규칙\n- 승인 시각은 UTC로 들어오고, 정산 일자는 KST 달력 날짜다.\n- 원화 환산은 거래 일자의 환율로, 원 단위 반올림(HALF_UP). JPY는 100엔당 환율.\n- 수수료는 일자·파트너 합계 원화에 bps를 곱해 원 미만 절사. 환불은 음수 금액으로 합산.\n- 비활성 파트너는 정산하지 않는다.\n\n## 테스트\n`bash test.sh` — 단위 검사(UnitChecks)와 E2E(SettlementE2ETest).\n# settlement batch configuration\nfxq.bin=vendor/bin/fxq\nfxq.timeoutSeconds=10\ndata.dir=fixtures\nbusiness.zone=Asia/Seoul\nboard.currencies=USD,EUR,JPY,CNY\npackage service;\n\nimport java.time.Instant;\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.time.ZoneId;\n\n/** Card approvals arrive in UTC; settlement and partner statements use the KST calendar date. */\npublic class BusinessDateResolver {\n    private final ZoneId zone;\n\n    public BusinessDateResolver(ZoneId zone) {\n        this.zone = zone;\n    }\n\n    public LocalDate dateOf(Instant approvedAt) {\n        return approvedAt.atZone(zone).toLocalDate();\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport java.util.Map;\n\n/** Maps a card currency to the vendor pair code and its quotation unit. */\npublic final class CurrencyPairs {\n    private static final Map<String, Integer> UNITS = Map.of(\"USD\", 1, \"EUR\", 1, \"JPY\", 100, \"CNY\", 1);\n\n    private CurrencyPairs() {}\n\n    public static String pairOf(String currency) {\n        requireSupported(currency);\n        return currency + \"KRW\";\n    }\n\n    /** JPY is quoted per 100 yen. */\n    public static int unitOf(String currency) {\n        requireSupported(currency);\n        return UNITS.get(currency);\n    }\n\n    public static boolean supported(String currency) {\n        return UNITS.containsKey(currency);\n    }\n\n    private static void requireSupported(String currency) {\n        if (!supported(currency)) throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"unsupported currency \" + currency);\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.FxQuote;\n\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\n\n/** Customer-facing exchange rate board for the app's travel wallet screen. */\npublic class RateBoardService {\n    private final RateService rates;\n    private final List<String> currencies;\n\n    public RateBoardService(RateService rates, List<String> currencies) {\n        this.rates = rates;\n        this.currencies = currencies;\n    }\n\n    public List<FxQuote> board(LocalDate date) {\n        List<FxQuote> out = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (String c : currencies) {\n            if (CurrencyPairs.supported(c)) out.add(rates.quote(c, date));\n        }\n        return out;\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.FxQuote;\nimport infra.FxqClient;\n\nimport java.math.BigDecimal;\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.util.HashMap;\nimport java.util.Map;\n\n/** FX rates for settlement and display, backed by the vendor CLI with a per-run cache. */\npublic class RateService {\n    private final FxqClient client;\n    private final Map<String, FxQuote> cache = new HashMap<>();\n    private int vendorCalls;\n\n    public RateService(FxqClient client) {\n        this.client = client;\n    }\n\n    public FxQuote quote(String currency, LocalDate date) {\n        String pair = CurrencyPairs.pairOf(currency);\n        return cache.computeIfAbsent(pair + \"@\" + date, k -> {\n            vendorCalls++;\n            return FxqClient.parse(client.rate(pair, date));\n        });\n    }\n\n    /** Rate applied to card transactions of the given KST settlement date. */\n    public BigDecimal settlementRate(String currency, LocalDate date) {\n        return quote(currency, date).rate();\n    }\n\n    public int vendorCalls() {\n        return vendorCalls;\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.DailyLine;\nimport domain.StatementRow;\n\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.HashMap;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Map;\n\n/** Compares our daily lines with the partners' statements. */\npublic class ReconcileService {\n\n    /** Difference between our settlement and the partner's statement for a date/partner. */\n    public record Mismatch(LocalDate date, String partnerId, String field, long ours, long theirs) {\n        public long diff() { return ours - theirs; }\n    }\n\n    public List<Mismatch> compare(List<DailyLine> ours, List<StatementRow> theirs) {\n        Map<String, DailyLine> mine = new HashMap<>();\n        for (DailyLine l : ours) mine.put(key(l.date(), l.partnerId()), l);\n        List<Mismatch> out = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (StatementRow r : theirs) {\n            DailyLine l = mine.remove(key(r.date(), r.partnerId()));\n            if (l == null) {\n                out.add(new Mismatch(r.date(), r.partnerId(), \"missing\", 0, r.grossKrw()));\n                continue;\n            }\n            if (l.count() != r.count()) out.add(new Mismatch(r.date(), r.partnerId(), \"count\", l.count(), r.count()));\n            if (l.grossKrw() != r.grossKrw()) out.add(new Mismatch(r.date(), r.partnerId(), \"gross\", l.grossKrw(), r.grossKrw()));\n        }\n        for (DailyLine l : mine.values()) {\n            out.add(new Mismatch(l.date(), l.partnerId(), \"unexpected\", l.grossKrw(), 0));\n        }\n        out.sort((a, b) -> a.date().equals(b.date()) ? a.partnerId().compareTo(b.partnerId()) : a.date().compareTo(b.date()));\n        return out;\n    }\n\n    private static String key(LocalDate d, String partner) {\n        return d + \"|\" + partner;\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.DailyLine;\nimport domain.Partner;\nimport domain.Transaction;\nimport infra.DataFiles;\nimport util.Money;\n\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Map;\nimport java.util.TreeMap;\n\n/** Builds per-partner daily settlement lines from the transaction feed. */\npublic class SettlementService {\n    private final DataFiles data;\n    private final RateService rates;\n    private final BusinessDateResolver dates;\n\n    public SettlementService(DataFiles data, RateService rates, BusinessDateResolver dates) {\n        this.data = data;\n        this.rates = rates;\n        this.dates = dates;\n    }\n\n    public List<DailyLine> settle(LocalDate from, LocalDate to) {\n        Map<String, long[]> acc = new TreeMap<>(); // key \"date|partner\" -> {count, grossKrw}\n        for (Transaction t : data.transactions()) {\n            LocalDate d = dates.dateOf(t.approvedAt());\n            if (d.isBefore(from) || d.isAfter(to)) continue;\n            Partner p = data.partner(t.partnerId()).orElse(null);\n            if (p == null || !p.active()) continue;\n            long krw = convert(t, d);\n            long[] a = acc.computeIfAbsent(d + \"|\" + p.id(), k -> new long[2]);\n            a[0]++;\n            a[1] += krw;\n        }\n        List<DailyLine> out = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (var e : acc.entrySet()) {\n            String[] k = e.getKey().split(\"\\\\|\");\n            Partner p = data.partner(k[1]).orElseThrow();\n            long gross = e.getValue()[1];\n            out.add(new DailyLine(LocalDate.parse(k[0]), p.id(), (int) e.getValue()[0], gross,\n                    Money.fee(gross, p.feeBps())));\n        }\n        return out;\n    }\n\n    private long convert(Transaction t, LocalDate businessDate) {\n        var rate = rates.settlementRate(t.currency(), businessDate);\n        return Money.toKrw(t.signedAmount(), rate, CurrencyPairs.unitOf(t.currency()));\n    }\n}\npackage infra;\n\nimport domain.FxQuote;\n\nimport java.io.IOException;\nimport java.io.InputStream;\nimport java.math.BigDecimal;\nimport java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;\nimport java.nio.file.Path;\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit;\n\n/** Thin wrapper around the vendor quote CLI. One process per call. */\npublic class FxqClient {\n    private final Path bin;\n    private final long timeoutSeconds;\n\n    public FxqClient(Path bin, long timeoutSeconds) {\n        this.bin = bin;\n        this.timeoutSeconds = timeoutSeconds;\n    }\n\n    /** Raw stdout line for {@code fxq rate PAIR DATE}. */\n    public String rate(String pair, LocalDate date) {\n        List<String> cmd = new ArrayList<>();\n        cmd.add(bin.toString());\n        cmd.add(\"rate\");\n        cmd.add(pair);\n        cmd.add(date.toString());\n        return run(cmd);\n    }\n\n    /** Parses one quote line: {@code PAIR YYYY-MM-DD RATE ...}. */\n    public static FxQuote parse(String line) {\n        String[] t = line.trim().split(\"\\\\s+\");\n        if (t.length < 3) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"unexpected quote line: \" + line);\n        }\n        return new FxQuote(t[0], LocalDate.parse(t[1]), new BigDecimal(t[2]));\n    }\n\n    private String run(List<String> cmd) {\n        try {\n            Process p = new ProcessBuilder(cmd).start();\n            byte[] out;\n            byte[] err;\n            try (InputStream o = p.getInputStream(); InputStream e = p.getErrorStream()) {\n                out = o.readAllBytes();\n                err = e.readAllBytes();\n            }\n            if (!p.waitFor(timeoutSeconds, TimeUnit.SECONDS)) {\n                p.destroyForcibly();\n                throw new FxqException(\"timeout\", cmd);\n            }\n            if (p.exitValue() != 0) {\n                throw new FxqException(new String(err, StandardCharsets.UTF_8).trim(), cmd);\n            }\n            String line = new String(out, StandardCharsets.UTF_8).trim();\n            if (line.isEmpty()) throw new FxqException(\"empty output\", cmd);\n            return line;\n        } catch (IOException e) {\n            throw new FxqException(\"exec failed: \" + e.getMessage(), cmd);\n        } catch (InterruptedException e) {\n            Thread.currentThread().interrupt();\n            throw new FxqException(\"interrupted\", cmd);\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static class FxqException extends RuntimeException {\n        public FxqException(String code, List<String> cmd) {\n            super(\"fxq failed [\" + code + \"]: \" + String.join(\" \", cmd));\n        }\n    }\n}\n==> fixtures/partner-statement.csv <==\n# partner self-reported statements (KRW gross per KST date)\ndate,partner_id,count,gross_krw\n2026-10-01,P-1001,1,165965\n2026-10-01,P-1002,1,144108\n2026-10-01,P-1003,1,146286\n\n==> fixtures/partners.csv <==\npartner_id,name,fee_bps,active\nP-1001,트래블메이트,120,Y\nP-1002,글로벌기프트,250,Y\nP-1003,도쿄직구몰,180,Y\nP-1004,구제휴처,300,N\n\n==> fixtures/transactions.csv <==\n# acquirer feed, approved_at in UTC\ntxn_id,partner_id,approved_at,currency,amount,type\nT0001,P-1001,2026-10-01T01:12:00Z,USD,120.50,PURCHASE\nT0002,P-1002,2026-10-01T05:40:00Z,EUR,89.90,PURCHASE\nT0003,P-1003,2026-10-01T09:03:00Z,JPY,15800,PURCHASE\ntest:\nSettlementE2ETest.java\nTestSupport.java\nUnitChecks.java\n\nvendor:\nbin","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5696992b-ba8e-4aa4-81d3-6da04f01f8d4","uuid":"071f3508-b061-4eee-9cdd-c3a28ccf9342","timestamp":"2026-10-08T16:16:01.484Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# 한빛페이 해외카드 파트너 정산 (overseas-card-settlement)\n\n해외 가맹 파트너의 카드 승인 건을 원화로 환산해 일자·파트너별로 정산하고,\n파트너가 보내 주는 명세와 대사(reconcile)하는 배치/운영 콘솔이다.\n\n## 구성\n```\nsrc/api       SettlementApi(퍼사드), ReportFormatter, Main(운영 CLI)\nsrc/service   SettlementService, ReconcileService, RateService, RateBoardService, ...\nsrc/infra     FxqClient(환율 벤더 CLI 호출), DataFiles(CSV)\nsrc/domain    레코드 타입\nsrc/util      Money, Csv\nconf/         app.properties (SETTLE_* 환경변수 / -Dsettle.* 로 덮어쓰기)\nfixtures/     샘플 데이터 (2026-10-01 ~ 10-05)\nvendor/bin/   환율 벤더 제공 CLI `fxq` (벤더 배포본 — 저장소에서 수정하지 않는다)\n```\n\n## 실행\n```\nJDK=$HOME/.sdkman/candidates/java/21.0.5-tem/bin\n$JDK/javac -encoding UTF-8 -d out $(find src -name '*.java')\n$JDK/java -cp out api.Main report    2026-10-01 2026-10-05\n$JDK/java -cp out api.Main reconcile 2026-10-01 2026-10-05\n$JDK/java -cp out api.Main export    2026-10-01 2026-10-05\n$JDK/java -cp out api.Main board     2026-10-03\n```\n\n## 규칙\n- 승인 시각은 UTC로 들어오고, 정산 일자는 KST 달력 날짜다.\n- 원화 환산은 거래 일자의 환율로, 원 단위 반올림(HALF_UP). JPY는 100엔당 환율.\n- 수수료는 일자·파트너 합계 원화에 bps를 곱해 원 미만 절사. 환불은 음수 금액으로 합산.\n- 비활성 파트너는 정산하지 않는다.\n\n## 테스트\n`bash test.sh` — 단위 검사(UnitChecks)와 E2E(SettlementE2ETest).\n# settlement batch configuration\nfxq.bin=vendor/bin/fxq\nfxq.timeoutSeconds=10\ndata.dir=fixtures\nbusiness.zone=Asia/Seoul\nboard.currencies=USD,EUR,JPY,CNY\npackage service;\n\nimport java.time.Instant;\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.time.ZoneId;\n\n/** Card approvals arrive in UTC; settlement and partner statements use the KST calendar date. */\npublic class BusinessDateResolver {\n    private final ZoneId zone;\n\n    public BusinessDateResolver(ZoneId zone) {\n        this.zone = zone;\n    }\n\n    public LocalDate dateOf(Instant approvedAt) {\n        return approvedAt.atZone(zone).toLocalDate();\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport java.util.Map;\n\n/** Maps a card currency to the vendor pair code and its quotation unit. */\npublic final class CurrencyPairs {\n    private static final Map<String, Integer> UNITS = Map.of(\"USD\", 1, \"EUR\", 1, \"JPY\", 100, \"CNY\", 1);\n\n    private CurrencyPairs() {}\n\n    public static String pairOf(String currency) {\n        requireSupported(currency);\n        return currency + \"KRW\";\n    }\n\n    /** JPY is quoted per 100 yen. */\n    public static int unitOf(String currency) {\n        requireSupported(currency);\n        return UNITS.get(currency);\n    }\n\n    public static boolean supported(String currency) {\n        return UNITS.containsKey(currency);\n    }\n\n    private static void requireSupported(String currency) {\n        if (!supported(currency)) throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"unsupported currency \" + currency);\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.FxQuote;\n\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\n\n/** Customer-facing exchange rate board for the app's travel wallet screen. */\npublic class RateBoardService {\n    private final RateService rates;\n    private final List<String> currencies;\n\n    public RateBoardService(RateService rates, List<String> currencies) {\n        this.rates = rates;\n        this.currencies = currencies;\n    }\n\n    public List<FxQuote> board(LocalDate date) {\n        List<FxQuote> out = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (String c : currencies) {\n            if (CurrencyPairs.supported(c)) out.add(rates.quote(c, date));\n        }\n        return out;\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.FxQuote;\nimport infra.FxqClient;\n\nimport java.math.BigDecimal;\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.util.HashMap;\nimport java.util.Map;\n\n/** FX rates for settlement and display, backed by the vendor CLI with a per-run cache. */\npublic class RateService {\n    private final FxqClient client;\n    private final Map<String, FxQuote> cache = new HashMap<>();\n    private int vendorCalls;\n\n    public RateService(FxqClient client) {\n        this.client = client;\n    }\n\n    public FxQuote quote(String currency, LocalDate date) {\n        String pair = CurrencyPairs.pairOf(currency);\n        return cache.computeIfAbsent(pair + \"@\" + date, k -> {\n            vendorCalls++;\n            return FxqClient.parse(client.rate(pair, date));\n        });\n    }\n\n    /** Rate applied to card transactions of the given KST settlement date. */\n    public BigDecimal settlementRate(String currency, LocalDate date) {\n        return quote(currency, date).rate();\n    }\n\n    public int vendorCalls() {\n        return vendorCalls;\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.DailyLine;\nimport domain.StatementRow;\n\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.HashMap;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Map;\n\n/** Compares our daily lines with the partners' statements. */\npublic class ReconcileService {\n\n    /** Difference between our settlement and the partner's statement for a date/partner. */\n    public record Mismatch(LocalDate date, String partnerId, String field, long ours, long theirs) {\n        public long diff() { return ours - theirs; }\n    }\n\n    public List<Mismatch> compare(List<DailyLine> ours, List<StatementRow> theirs) {\n        Map<String, DailyLine> mine = new HashMap<>();\n        for (DailyLine l : ours) mine.put(key(l.date(), l.partnerId()), l);\n        List<Mismatch> out = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (StatementRow r : theirs) {\n            DailyLine l = mine.remove(key(r.date(), r.partnerId()));\n            if (l == null) {\n                out.add(new Mismatch(r.date(), r.partnerId(), \"missing\", 0, r.grossKrw()));\n                continue;\n            }\n            if (l.count() != r.count()) out.add(new Mismatch(r.date(), r.partnerId(), \"count\", l.count(), r.count()));\n            if (l.grossKrw() != r.grossKrw()) out.add(new Mismatch(r.date(), r.partnerId(), \"gross\", l.grossKrw(), r.grossKrw()));\n        }\n        for (DailyLine l : mine.values()) {\n            out.add(new Mismatch(l.date(), l.partnerId(), \"unexpected\", l.grossKrw(), 0));\n        }\n        out.sort((a, b) -> a.date().equals(b.date()) ? a.partnerId().compareTo(b.partnerId()) : a.date().compareTo(b.date()));\n        return out;\n    }\n\n    private static String key(LocalDate d, String partner) {\n        return d + \"|\" + partner;\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.DailyLine;\nimport domain.Partner;\nimport domain.Transaction;\nimport infra.DataFiles;\nimport util.Money;\n\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Map;\nimport java.util.TreeMap;\n\n/** Builds per-partner daily settlement lines from the transaction feed. */\npublic class SettlementService {\n    private final DataFiles data;\n    private final RateService rates;\n    private final BusinessDateResolver dates;\n\n    public SettlementService(DataFiles data, RateService rates, BusinessDateResolver dates) {\n        this.data = data;\n        this.rates = rates;\n        this.dates = dates;\n    }\n\n    public List<DailyLine> settle(LocalDate from, LocalDate to) {\n        Map<String, long[]> acc = new TreeMap<>(); // key \"date|partner\" -> {count, grossKrw}\n        for (Transaction t : data.transactions()) {\n            LocalDate d = dates.dateOf(t.approvedAt());\n            if (d.isBefore(from) || d.isAfter(to)) continue;\n            Partner p = data.partner(t.partnerId()).orElse(null);\n            if (p == null || !p.active()) continue;\n            long krw = convert(t, d);\n            long[] a = acc.computeIfAbsent(d + \"|\" + p.id(), k -> new long[2]);\n            a[0]++;\n            a[1] += krw;\n        }\n        List<DailyLine> out = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (var e : acc.entrySet()) {\n            String[] k = e.getKey().split(\"\\\\|\");\n            Partner p = data.partner(k[1]).orElseThrow();\n            long gross = e.getValue()[1];\n            out.add(new DailyLine(LocalDate.parse(k[0]), p.id(), (int) e.getValue()[0], gross,\n                    Money.fee(gross, p.feeBps())));\n        }\n        return out;\n    }\n\n    private long convert(Transaction t, LocalDate businessDate) {\n        var rate = rates.settlementRate(t.currency(), businessDate);\n        return Money.toKrw(t.signedAmount(), rate, CurrencyPairs.unitOf(t.currency()));\n    }\n}\npackage infra;\n\nimport domain.FxQuote;\n\nimport java.io.IOException;\nimport java.io.InputStream;\nimport java.math.BigDecimal;\nimport java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;\nimport java.nio.file.Path;\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit;\n\n/** Thin wrapper around the vendor quote CLI. One process per call. */\npublic class FxqClient {\n    private final Path bin;\n    private final long timeoutSeconds;\n\n    public FxqClient(Path bin, long timeoutSeconds) {\n        this.bin = bin;\n        this.timeoutSeconds = timeoutSeconds;\n    }\n\n    /** Raw stdout line for {@code fxq rate PAIR DATE}. */\n    public String rate(String pair, LocalDate date) {\n        List<String> cmd = new ArrayList<>();\n        cmd.add(bin.toString());\n        cmd.add(\"rate\");\n        cmd.add(pair);\n        cmd.add(date.toString());\n        return run(cmd);\n    }\n\n    /** Parses one quote line: {@code PAIR YYYY-MM-DD RATE ...}. */\n    public static FxQuote parse(String line) {\n        String[] t = line.trim().split(\"\\\\s+\");\n        if (t.length < 3) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"unexpected quote line: \" + line);\n        }\n        return new FxQuote(t[0], LocalDate.parse(t[1]), new BigDecimal(t[2]));\n    }\n\n    private String run(List<String> cmd) {\n        try {\n            Process p = new ProcessBuilder(cmd).start();\n            byte[] out;\n            byte[] err;\n            try (InputStream o = p.getInputStream(); InputStream e = p.getErrorStream()) {\n                out = o.readAllBytes();\n                err = e.readAllBytes();\n            }\n            if (!p.waitFor(timeoutSeconds, TimeUnit.SECONDS)) {\n                p.destroyForcibly();\n                throw new FxqException(\"timeout\", cmd);\n            }\n            if (p.exitValue() != 0) {\n                throw new FxqException(new String(err, StandardCharsets.UTF_8).trim(), cmd);\n            }\n            String line = new String(out, StandardCharsets.UTF_8).trim();\n            if (line.isEmpty()) throw new FxqException(\"empty output\", cmd);\n            return line;\n        } catch (IOException e) {\n            throw new FxqException(\"exec failed: \" + e.getMessage(), cmd);\n        } catch (InterruptedException e) {\n            Thread.currentThread().interrupt();\n            throw new FxqException(\"interrupted\", cmd);\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static class FxqException extends RuntimeException {\n        public FxqException(String code, List<String> cmd) {\n            super(\"fxq failed [\" + code + \"]: \" + String.join(\" \", cmd));\n        }\n    }\n}\n==> fixtures/partner-statement.csv <==\n# partner self-reported statements (KRW gross per KST date)\ndate,partner_id,count,gross_krw\n2026-10-01,P-1001,1,165965\n2026-10-01,P-1002,1,144108\n2026-10-01,P-1003,1,146286\n\n==> fixtures/partners.csv <==\npartner_id,name,fee_bps,active\nP-1001,트래블메이트,120,Y\nP-1002,글로벌기프트,250,Y\nP-1003,도쿄직구몰,180,Y\nP-1004,구제휴처,300,N\n\n==> fixtures/transactions.csv <==\n# acquirer feed, approved_at in UTC\ntxn_id,partner_id,approved_at,currency,amount,type\nT0001,P-1001,2026-10-01T01:12:00Z,USD,120.50,PURCHASE\nT0002,P-1002,2026-10-01T05:40:00Z,EUR,89.90,PURCHASE\nT0003,P-1003,2026-10-01T09:03:00Z,JPY,15800,PURCHASE\ntest:\nSettlementE2ETest.java\nTestSupport.java\nUnitChecks.java\n\nvendor:\nbin","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImag